@startuml post-manager-interest
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/manager/v1/interest
caption CRB-58 · 관심 분야 추가 (맨 뒤에 붙음)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminInterestController" as Controller
participant "AdminInterestService" as Service
participant "AdminInterestRepository" as AdminInterestRepository
participant "InterestService" as InterestService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: POST /api/manager/v1/interest\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ name }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt name이 문자열이 아님, trim 후 비었거나 50자 초과
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: create(req)
Controller -> Service: create(req)
group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: lockForWrite(tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: LOCK TABLE interest IN SHARE ROW EXCLUSIVE MODE
  note right of AdminInterestRepository
    pk · sort_order를 MAX + 1로 정하고 이름 중복을 미리 확인하므로 쓰기를 한 줄로 세움.
    SELECT는 막지 않음. 어드민 쓰기는 드물어 대기가 거의 없음
  end note
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: findByName(name, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT interest WHERE name = ?
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: row | 없음
  alt 같은 이름이 있음
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 This interest name already exists.
  end
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: insert(name, tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT interest (pk = MAX(pk) + 1, name, sort_order = MAX(sort_order) + 1) RETURNING
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: row
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답
Service -> InterestService: refresh()
ref over Service, PostgreSQL: 커밋 뒤 이 인스턴스 캐시를 다시 읽음 — flow/interest-cache-bootstrap.puml\n재조회 실패는 로그만 남기고 응답은 성공
Service --> Controller: AdminInterestDto
Controller --> Client: 201 { pk, name, sort_order }

@enduml
